'''South Seas Doge''' (南国わんこ, ''Nangoku Wanko'', '''Southern Land Doggy''') is a [[:Category:Traitless Enemies|Traitless]] variant of [[Doge]] that appears in [[Island Defenders!]]. It was added in [[Version 14.5 Update|Version 14.5]].

{{Enemy Info
|name = South Seas Doge
|image = e 736.png
|first appearance = [[Island Defenders!]]
|money drop = 50¢ - 197¢
}}

==Enemy==
A slightly stronger [[Doge]] with a chance to Knockback and Survive lethal strikes.

==Strategy==
His stats aren't very high so he can be easily killed like a Doge.

